# Local Claude Code tooling state (settings, session state, etc.) - but the
# shared skills under .claude/skills/ and guides under .claude/guides/ ARE
# tracked. Note the contents of .claude must be excluded rather than the
# directory itself: git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is
# excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/guides/
.claude 2/

